---
title: The OG Smoothie
servings: 5
time required: 5 minutes
course: Drink
cuisine: American
image: https://cookingformysoul.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/mixed-berry-smoothie-3-min.jpg
---

In a #blender, blend together @banana{1.5}(frozen), @mixed berries{1%handful}(frozen), @?oatmeal{1/4%cup}(old-fashioned oats), @honey{dash}, @?vanilla protein powder{2%scoops}, @?strawberry protein powder{1%scoop}, @liquids{4%cups}(Costco Almond Milk is perfect for this, but a blend of Orange Juice, any milk, or water works), @peanut butter{1.5%tbsp}(heaping), @?orange Emergen-C packets{3}, and @?multi-vitamins{3}(blended) until smooth.

> This is very much a throw together whatever you have/like type recipe, but it's our go-to choices.